{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-cxjh-pqwp-8mfp","cve_id":"CVE-2024-28849","url":"https://api.github.com/advisories/GHSA-cxjh-pqwp-8mfp","html_url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-cxjh-pqwp-8mfp","summary":"follow-redirects' Proxy-Authorization header kept across hosts","description":"When using [axios](https://github.com/axios/axios), its dependency follow-redirects only clears authorization header during cross-domain redirect, but allows the proxy-authentication header which contains credentials too.\n\n## Steps To Reproduce & PoC\n\nTest code:\n\n```js\nconst axios = require('axios');\n\naxios.get('http://127.0.0.1:10081/', {\n headers: {\n 'AuThorization': 'Rear Test',\n 'ProXy-AuthoriZation': 'Rear Test',\n 'coOkie': 't=1'\n }\n})\n .then((response) => {\n console.log(response);\n })\n```\n\nWhen I meet the cross-domain redirect, the sensitive headers like authorization and cookie are cleared, but proxy-authentication header is kept.\n\n## Impact\n\nThis vulnerability may lead to credentials leak.\n\n## Recommendations\n\nRemove proxy-authentication header during cross-domain redirect\n\n### Recommended Patch\n\n[follow-redirects/index.js:464](https://github.com/follow-redirects/follow-redirects/commit/c4f847f85176991f95ab9c88af63b1294de8649b)\n\n```diff\n- removeMatchingHeaders(/^(?:authorization|cookie)$/i, this._options.headers);\n+ removeMatchingHeaders(/^(?:authorization|proxy-authorization|cookie)$/i, this._options.headers);\n```","type":"reviewed","severity":"medium","repository_advisory_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/follow-redirects/follow-redirects/security-advisories/GHSA-cxjh-pqwp-8mfp","source_code_location":"https://github.com/follow-redirects/follow-redirects","identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-cxjh-pqwp-8mfp","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2024-28849","type":"CVE"}],"references":["https://github.com/follow-redirects/follow-redirects/security/advisories/GHSA-cxjh-pqwp-8mfp","https://github.com/follow-redirects/follow-redirects/commit/c4f847f85176991f95ab9c88af63b1294de8649b","https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#authentication-entries","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-28849","https://github.com/psf/requests/issues/1885","https://hackerone.com/reports/2390009","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/VOIF4EPQUCKDBEVTGRQDZ3CGTYQHPO7Z","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-cxjh-pqwp-8mfp"],"published_at":"2024-03-14T17:19:42Z","updated_at":"2024-04-02T17:54:22Z","github_reviewed_at":"2024-03-14T17:19:42Z","nvd_published_at":"2024-03-14T17:15:52Z","withdrawn_at":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"npm","name":"follow-redirects"},"vulnerable_version_range":"<= 1.15.5","first_patched_version":"1.15.6","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N","score":6.5},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":null,"score":0.0}},"cwes":[{"cwe_id":"CWE-200","name":"Exposure of Sensitive Information to an Unauthorized Actor"}],"credits":[{"user":{"login":"4xpl0r3r","id":20693041,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjkzMDQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20693041?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/4xpl0r3r","html_url":"https://github.com/4xpl0r3r","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4xpl0r3r/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4xpl0r3r/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4xpl0r3r/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4xpl0r3r/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4xpl0r3r/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4xpl0r3r/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4xpl0r3r/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4xpl0r3r/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/4xpl0r3r/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"type":"reporter"},{"user":{"login":"RDIL","id":345